 "intro": "The Student Dismissal App lets a student ask to leave school early. You build the welcome screen, a form for the student ID, name and grade, a request form with a calendar, a list of requests and a slip to show at the school gate.",
 "goals": [
  "Build a real form-based app that saves and shows information.",
  "Learn how a calendar, a time picker and drop-down lists collect clean data.",
  "Understand how saved records can be linked together.",
  "Finish with an app you can package and publish to Google Play."
 ],
 "studentWill": [
  "Create a form for the student’s SID, name and grade.",
  "Add a calendar that picks the date and fills in the day.",
  "Choose a time, write a reason and submit a dismissal request.",
  "See every request in a list and view the newest one as a gate slip."
 ],
